WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Add a recording

00:04.000 --> 00:08.850
Split it into steps where the explanation changes

00:08.850 --> 00:18.950
Type captions right on the preview

00:18.950 --> 00:25.020
For a zoom, draw a box around the area to show

00:25.020 --> 00:32.200
Play it back to check on the spot

00:32.200 --> 00:37.250
Boxes and arrows go on the preview too

00:37.250 --> 00:40.450
Click Export

00:40.450 --> 00:43.500
Wait for the export to finish (sped up)

00:43.500 --> 00:45.763
The mp4 is ready

00:45.763 --> 01:03.933
The finished video
